@title Cabinet: Autogroup by wiring and heat previews first, names its estimates, Cancel stores nothing, one Undo
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Where the user finds it: Cabinet workspace, Arrange; Ctrl K "group by heat", "autogroup wiring", "autogroup wiring and heat".
# Part 1, the made-up heat cabinet (qa/fixtures/heat-place-all.novo, planning values, no wires): Place all puts the devices on rails.
# Group by heat alone is refused there in words (it would break place rules); Group by wiring and heat has no wires so it runs as heat alone and is refused the same way; Group by wiring says there is no wiring.
# Part 2, the cooler cabinet (qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo): Group by wiring and heat shows a preview banner with its estimates ("not a temperature"); Esc stores nothing; Accept is one undo step.
open qa/fixtures/heat-place-all.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key Enter
wait 20
shot placed
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text group by heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot heat-refused
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text autogroup wiring and heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "No wiring between these devices"
shot both-refused-no-wires
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text group by wiring
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "No wiring between these devices"
shot wiring-refused
check_layout
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text autogroup wiring and heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Preview (Autogroup by wiring and heat)"
expect "not a temperature"
shot both-preview
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
shot both-cancelled
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text autogroup wiring and heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
key Enter
wait 20
shot both-accepted
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot both-undone
